    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It'sRoachTime! - is a hardcore, third person 3D online pvp fighting arena game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Fight as a mutant cockroach in real time insect simulator, find your way to survive, destroy them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Various themed arenas in the post-Soviet apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Standard weapons are the past, fight with homemade needles, razor blades, paws of birds and insects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* How you decide to defeat your opponents is entirely up to you. Assault from the front and fight all at once or ambush enemies one at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Unique cockroach music and sound effects from the &quot;Henry&quot; band.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Comic Artist's works Sergei Kritzien.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* The apartment is fraught with danger: gas fire, explosions and falls. We add more and more dangerous surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984790/extras/f5bfb3e1845718a749f853ed201f328c.poster.avif?t=1735066218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984790/extras/f5bfb3e1845718a749f853ed201f328c.webm?t=1735066218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984790/extras/f5bfb3e1845718a749f853ed201f328c.mp4?t=1735066218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It'sRoachTime! - is a hardcore, third person 3D online pvp fighting arena game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Fight as a mutant cockroach in real time insect simulator, find your way to survive, destroy them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Various themed arenas in the post-Soviet apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Standard weapons are the past, fight with homemade needles, razor blades, paws of birds and insects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* How you decide to defeat your opponents is entirely up to you. Assault from the front and fight all at once or ambush enemies one at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Unique cockroach music and sound effects from the &quot;Henry&quot; band.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* Comic Artist's works Sergei Kritzien.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">* The apartment is fraught with danger: gas fire, explosions and falls. We add more and more dangerous surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984790/extras/f5bfb3e1845718a749f853ed201f328c.poster.avif?t=1735066218\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984790/extras/f5bfb3e1845718a749f853ed201f328c.webm?t=1735066218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984790/extras/f5bfb3e1845718a749f853ed201f328c.mp4?t=1735066218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
